# Allure App Deployment Guide

This guide provides step-by-step instructions on how to deploy the Allure application using Docker Compose.

## Prerequisites

- Docker and Docker Compose installed on your machine
- A Docker Hub account
- Git (optional, for cloning the repository)

## Deployment Steps

### 1. BUILD PROJECT

`docker-compose -f docker-compose.build.yaml build`

### 2. PUSH PROJECT

`docker-compose -f docker-compose.build.yaml push`

### 3. RUN NETWORK

`docker-compose up -d`
